는 남성의 사진을 게시한 후 불거졌습니다. \"2nd Theatre Photosynthesis System\" 이라는 단어가 단순화되어 나타나는 것을 보았습니다."},{"title":"Chinese schools spark controversy over strict hair policy barring non-compliant male students","url":"https://www.scmp.com/news/people-culture/trending-china/article/3365760/chinese-schools-spark-controversy-over-strict-hair-policy-barring-non-compliant-male-students?utm_source=rss_feed","source":"SCMP (홍콩)","summary":"Two schools in northwestern China have ignited controversy by enforcing a strict hairstyle policy on students, who may be stopped at the school gate or even turned away if they fail to comply with the requirements. August 23 marked the first day of the new school term at Yinchuan High School and Yinchuan No 24 Middle School in Yinchuan, the capital city of the Ningxia Hui autonomous region. Viral ","published":"2026-09-01T10:00:13+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"title_ko":"중국 학교는 부적합한 남성 학생을 금지하는 엄격한 모발 정책에 대한 논란을 불러일으킨다.","summary_ko":"중국 북서부의 두 학교는 학생들에게 엄격한 헤어스타일 정책을 시행함으로써 논란에 불을 지폈습니다. 학생이 요구 사항을 준수하지 않으면 교문에서 멈추거나 심지어 외면당할 수도 있습니다. 8월 23일은 닝샤 후이족 자치구의 수도인 인촨에 있는 인촨 고등학교와 인촨 24번 중학교의 새 학기 첫날이었습니다. 바이러스"},{"title":"News live: South Australia says block on telehealth for voluntary assisted dying creates ‘barrier’ for equitable access","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/01/nepal-tibet-flooding-missing-australians-penny-wong-anthony-albanese-pacific-islands-forum-liberal-national-coalition-one-nation-politics-reactions-ntwnfb","source":"The Guardian","summary":"Follow updates liveGet our breaking news email, free app or daily news podcast43 Australians still missing, with concerns growing ‘every day, every hour’ that goes by, Wong saysThe foreign affairs minister, Penny Wong, says there are still 43 Australian missing after the flooding in Nepal, saying the government holds grave concerns for their safety that only gets worse as the days go by.This is su","published":"2026-09-01T09:59:18+09:00","lang":"en","related